00:25:33,089 --> 00:25:36,720
VAAISH YOARREE TA MEE MY LHIE EISHT DOOYRT

423
00:25:36,720 --> 00:25:40,140
REE LURGAGHYN VE CURRIT DA JUAN FIRRYNAGH

424
00:25:41,579 --> 00:25:45,120
VA JUAN FIRRINAGH Y SHARVAANT ENNOIL ECHEY AS

425
00:25:45,119 --> 00:25:48,150
VE ENMYSSIT YN AGHT SHOH ERYNOYR DY ROW

426
00:25:48,150 --> 00:25:51,119
EE ER CHUR ROISH Y REE DY FIRRINAGH

427
00:25:51,180 --> 00:25:52,289
OOILLEY NY LAGHYN ECHEY

428
00:25:53,849 --> 00:25:56,159
TRA HAINK EH FAGGYS DA LHIABBEE DOOYRT Y

429
00:25:56,190 --> 00:26:00,449
REE RISH IEUAN FIRRINAGH TA MEE GENNAGHTYN DY

430
00:26:00,450 --> 00:26:03,539
VEL ERJERREY AYM TAYRN ERGERREY AS YN UN

431
00:26:03,539 --> 00:26:05,819
CHIARAIL AYM SHEN SON MY VAC

432
00:26:06,839 --> 00:26:09,539
T'EH FO SMAGHT NY PREACHER BURGAGE AS CHA

433
00:26:09,539 --> 00:26:11,490
NEL FYS SHICKYR DY KINJAGH ER YN AGHT

434
00:26:11,490 --> 00:26:14,190
DY REAGHEY YN IMBAGH ECHEY AS MANNAGH VEL

435
00:26:14,190 --> 00:26:16,950
OO CUR GIALDIN DOU DY YNSAGHEY AYNS OOILLEY

436
00:26:16,950 --> 00:26:20,939
NY TE DY YANOO AS DRAMADEYR DOLTANAGH FIRRINAGH

437
00:26:20,940 --> 00:26:25,289
DA CHA BEE EH DY GHOONEY MY HOOILLYN

438
00:26:25,289 --> 00:26:25,920
AYNS SHEE

439
00:26:27,869 --> 00:26:32,640
EISHT DREGGYR JUAN FIRRINAGH CHA JEANYM ARRAGH TREIGEIL

440
00:26:32,640 --> 00:26:37,529
EH AS NEEYM SHIRVEISHAGH SHARE DY FIRRINAGH YORK

441
00:26:37,529 --> 00:26:39,419
DY JEANYM COAYL MY VIOYS

442
00:26:41,430 --> 00:26:45,329
AS DOOYRT AYNS SHENN REE EISHT TA MEE

443
00:26:45,329 --> 00:26:48,269
GEDDYN BAASE AS AIGNEY MIE AYM RISH SHEE

444
00:26:48,269 --> 00:26:48,839
YEE ORRYM

445
00:26:50,099 --> 00:26:51,750
AS EISHT HIE EH ER DY GHRA

446
00:26:52,799 --> 00:26:56,730
LURG GOBAITH AYM SHEGIN DHYT JEILYR TROOID Y

447
00:26:56,789 --> 00:27:00,660
CLANE CHASHTAL STIAGH AYNS OOILLEY NY SHAMYRYN AS

448
00:27:00,660 --> 00:27:04,259
AARLAGHEY NY SHELLANYN AS SOILSHAGHEY MAGH DA NY

449
00:27:04,259 --> 00:27:08,970
TASHTAGHYN TA NYN LHIE AYNDAUE AGH AYNS SHAMYR

450
00:27:08,970 --> 00:27:13,230
S'JERREE SOLO LIAUYR AYNJEE TA NY LHIE FOLLIT

451
00:27:13,710 --> 00:27:17,609
Y CASLYS JIU BENPHRINSE OF LAA SEYR SHEGIN

452
00:27:17,609 --> 00:27:21,720
DHYT GYN SOILSHAGHEY MAGH SHEN DA DY JINNAGH

453
00:27:21,720 --> 00:27:26,160
EH FAKIN Y CASHTAL SHEN YINNAGH EH CHELLEERAGH

454
00:27:26,400 --> 00:27:29,969
TUITTYM WHEESH AYNS GRAIH CHUM MOOAREARROO SHIONE DHYT

455
00:27:30,000 --> 00:27:33,059
JUAN NAGH LHIG GOLL MYNEALLOO VEIH'N JACK JEH

456
00:27:34,049 --> 00:27:35,970
NY LURG SHEN ER Y SON CUR EH

457
00:27:35,970 --> 00:27:37,380
HENE AYNS GHOW YN MOOAR

458
00:27:38,460 --> 00:27:41,100
MYR SHOH DOOYRT Y REE SHEGIN DHYT FREAYLL

459
00:27:41,099 --> 00:27:42,269
ARREY ER DY MIE

460
00:27:44,220 --> 00:27:46,440
Y GHAILCK HUG JUAN FIRRINAGH Y LAUE ECHEY

461
00:27:46,440 --> 00:27:49,860
ER YN SHENN REE DY VE KIUNE VOISH

462
00:27:49,859 --> 00:27:53,339
TOSTAGH HUG EE Y CHIONE ER Y CLOOISHAG

463
00:27:54,269 --> 00:27:55,289
AS HOOAR EH BAASE

464
00:28:03,119 --> 00:28:05,220
AYNS GLARE NY GEILL SHE SKEEALYN FERRISH NY

465
00:28:05,220 --> 00:28:07,860
BRAARAGHYN GRIMM TA RY CHLASHTYN VOISH CHYNDAAYS SY

466
00:28:07,859 --> 00:28:10,950
GHAELG FASTYR BEG YN DOOINNEY EDYR SHE BEEYM

467
00:28:11,069 --> 00:28:12,000
AS SHIAGHT BIO

468
00:28:13,019 --> 00:28:15,299
AS MYR SHOH TA SHIN YRJIT DYS JERREY

469
00:28:15,299 --> 00:28:17,460
FO CUR SHOH REESHT AS LIEH ABBYR SHEN

470
00:28:17,460 --> 00:28:20,429
REESHT REN OO SESSAY

471
00:28:24,809 --> 00:28:28,049
INNIS JUANEY FASSAN VEIH HIAR

472
00:28:30,059 --> 00:28:33,060
YIASS VOSES INJILLID LATELUNCH CHA MIE

473
00:28:34,559 --> 00:28:36,930
LHIAM LHIAH IF IT'S FREEZING ALTERNATIVE

474
00:28:38,789 --> 00:28:40,829
LESH Y GHAELG OO HENE AS DTY HIE

475
00:28:41,819 --> 00:28:46,919
HIS OF AFORESAID VEIH-SHOH IS IT ASSAILS IS

476
00:28:46,920 --> 00:28:49,290
LAA JEH'N PHOSSAN SHOH

477
00:28:53,130 --> 00:28:54,029
EARISHYN DY VIE

